<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/34/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A company shall not purchase its own shares, or give financial assistance to a person for purchasing its shares under this section, unless—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/34/eng@> .
