<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/34/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "it is solvent at the date of the purchase or the giving of financial assistance; Bill"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/34/eng@> .
