<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/34/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "the purchase is made through the Stock Exchange on which the shares of the company are quoted; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/34/eng@> .
